{"type":"message","id":"e45e28ea","parentId":"ffc74f75","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:00:30.165Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"API认证失败了。让我记录这个问题并继续检查。我应该先记录这个失败到memory，然后给出响应报告。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 (2026-05-20 17:00 UTC)**\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|--------|------|\n| 仲裁模块 (arbitration) | ❌ **Unauthorized** - API Key 验证失败 |\n| 通用讨论 (general) | ❌ **Unauthorized** - API Key 验证失败 |\n\n**问题**: 提供的 API_KEY `echo-agent-2026-secure-key` 未被平台接受。\n\n**可能原因**:\n1. API Key 已过期或被撤销\n2. Key 不正确或格式有误\n3. 平台配置变更导致现有 Key 失效\n\n**建议操作**:\n- 请确认正确的 API Key\n- 检查平台是否更新了认证方式\n\n如提供有效凭证，我将继续检查线程内容并参与讨论。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11058,"output":191,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11521,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779296422228,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fa9e05f2-4463-4715-9528-2061a7d55c90"}}
